SUMMARY:Anderson Brothers play Benny Goodman
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Grammy-Winning virtuosos on clarinet (New York Times)\, the Jui
 
lliard graduates\, identical twins\, and Washington\, DC natives Peter Sing
 
\, Sing\, Sing\, Stompin at the Savoy\, Lets Dance\, and Dont Be That Way. 
 
Raised in poverty in Chicago\, Benny Goodman was a classical clarinet prodi
 
gy who sparked an international swing craze in the 1930s\, and premiered th
 
e first jazz concert at Carnegie Hall in 1938. Peter and Will Anderson have
 
 headlined at The Blue Note\, Jazz at Lincoln Center\, The Kennedy Center\,
 
 New Orleans Jazz Festival\, Feinsteins 54 Below\, live on Garrison Keillor
 
s Prairie Home Companion\, and can be heard on the Grammy-winning soundtrac
 
k of HBOs Boardwalk Empire with Vince Giordanos Nighthawks. Peter and Will 
 
can be heard and seen in the major motion pictures Revolutionary Road\, Kil
 
lers of the Flower Moon\, Boardwalk Empire\, and The Marvelous Ms. Maisel. 
 
www.PeterAndWillAnderson.com Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/even
 
t/anderson-brothers-play-benny-goodman-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14228414
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/anderson-brothers-play-benny-goodman-bi
 
rdland-jazz-club-tickets/14228414
END:VEVENT
